; DNS records for masarmetro.sa — the site part, ready to import.
; Most DNS panels (including Cloudflare: DNS > Records > Import) accept this file as is.
; Mail records (MX, SPF, DKIM, verification TXT) come from the mail provider's panel; add them after import.
$ORIGIN masarmetro.sa.
$TTL 3600
@     IN A     185.199.108.153
@     IN A     185.199.109.153
@     IN A     185.199.110.153
@     IN A     185.199.111.153
@     IN AAAA  2606:50c0:8000::153
@     IN AAAA  2606:50c0:8001::153
@     IN AAAA  2606:50c0:8002::153
@     IN AAAA  2606:50c0:8003::153
www   IN CNAME monerah-giv.github.io.
_dmarc IN TXT  "v=DMARC1; p=none; rua=mailto:info@masarmetro.sa"
